This adapter reuses the immutable public image and launch scripts from
0xSero/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-spark-sparkinfer at commit
d370c0f0806a9ac994dc5f354715576cc23840b9 (Apache-2.0).

Vonk supplies the exact 0xSero/deepseek-v4-flash-0731-spark snapshot from its
digest-bound artifact store at /models/weights. The adapter invokes the
upstream lossless TP4-to-TP1 coalescer, target verifier, K64 DSpark draft
builder, SparkInfer self-test, and serving launcher without downloading or
modifying the published target checkpoint. Derived products and compiled
caches are namespaced by the unchanged executable payload revision under the
isolated /outputs mount, so README-only snapshot refreshes do not rebuild
identical data.

The recipe remains a Candidate until a Vonk-managed physical Spark canary is
recorded; Candidate status does not disable installation or execution.

The adapter installs the Apache-2.0 XGrammar 0.2.3 CPython 3.12 ARM64 wheel from
PyPI, pinned by SHA-256
11255f184971489fc72b948b096e2917f482ba2dca975177f5411562cedb9c6d, to provide
the normalize_tool_choice API required by the pinned vLLM tool parser. This
matches the upstream correction merged at
d370c0f0806a9ac994dc5f354715576cc23840b9, whose published image digest is
unchanged.
